# Utility mods for NeoForge 1.21.1

These are mods that are essential for creating, removing, and editing aspects of the game to create custom content and unique experiences for a modpack.


| Name | Links | Description | Alternatives |
|------|-------|-------------| --------------|
| Almost Unified | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/almostunified) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/almost-unified) | Unify all resources | - |
| AStages | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astages) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/astages) | Restrict nearly every aspect of gameplay based on progression | [Game Stages](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/game-stages) |
| Bad Mobs | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bad-mobs) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/bad-mobs) | Simple blacklist for mob spawns | - |
| Biome Replacer | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-replacer) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/biome-replacer) | A quick way to get rid of a biome | - |
| CraftTweaker | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/crafttweaker) | Change recipes, script events, add new commands, and change item properties with ZenScript | - |
| Custom Machinery | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-machinery) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/custom-machinery) | Create custom machines via JSON | - |
| Defaulted | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/defaulted) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/defaulted) | Adds registry to control default item components. | - |
| Emendatus Enigmatica | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emendatus-enigmatica) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/emendatusenigmatica) | Dynamic material registry system, with world generation, compat, and many other features | - |
| FancyMenu | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancymenu) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/fancymenu) | Customize Minecraft menus in an in-game GUI editor | [PackMenu](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packmenu) for Neo/Forge |
| Featurify | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/featurify) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/featurify) | A worldgen feature configuration mod that eliminates the need for datapacks. Add, remove, and tweak features in any biome. | - |
| Iglee's Modpack Utilities | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/imu) | Allows for farmland soil configuration, compressed block creation, and lore additions | - |
| In Control | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/in-control) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/in-control) | Control mob spawns via verbose JSON configuration | - |
| JSON Things | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/json-things) | A mod that enables players to define blocks and items (and more!) via thingpacks, zip files similar to datapacks and resource packs | - |
| KubeJS | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/kubejs) | Edit recipes, add new custom items, script world events through JavaScript | - |
| Lithostitched | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithostitched) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/lithostitched) | Library mod with new configurability and compatibility enhancements for worldgen | - |
| Lychee | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lychee) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/lychee) | Define in-world crafting & interactions using JSON recipes, such as item interaction, burning, touching fluid, anvil, crushing, lightning, and exploding. | - |
| Mob Control | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ohaydens-mob-control) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/mob-control) | Rule-based mob spawning and AI configuration. Closed Source. | - |
| Modular Machinery Reborn | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modular-machinery-reborn) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/modular-machinery-reborn) | Create custom machines via JSON or KubeJS | - |
| Multiblocked2 | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multiblocked2) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/multiblocked2) | Powerful visual custom machine/multiblock mod | - |
| Neutron Tools | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neutron-tools) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/neutron-tools) | Configure creative inventory, portal wait time, and hunger speeds | - |
| One Enough Enchantment | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/one-enough-enchantment) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/one-enough-enchantment) | Dynamically control the weight of enchantments or even completely remove enchantments. | - |
| One Enough Item | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/one-enough-item) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/one-enough-item) | Replace duplicate items with a single designated representative item | - |
| Open Loader | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/open-loader) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/open-loader) | Allows data packs and resource packs to be applied globally across all save files in a game instance. | [Paxi](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paxi) |
| Recreative | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recreative) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/recreative) | Dynamic, data-driven Creative Mode tabs via simple JSON configuration | [Neutron Tools](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neutron-tools) has similar Creative Tab customization features. |
| Reliable Recipes | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliable-recipes) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/reliable-recipes) | Dynamic recipe and tag manipulation via simple JSON configuration | - |
| Reliable Remover | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliable-remover) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/reliable-remover) | Allows for completely removing items via simple JSON configuration. | [Item Obliterator](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-obliterator), though this mod was made to address critical issues of it. |
| Reliable Replacer | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliable-replacer) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/reliable-replacer) | Allows for replacing one block with another, both during worldgen and afterward. | [Block Swap](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-swap), though this mod was made to address critical issues of it. [One Enough Block](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/one-enough-block) |
| Structurify | [CF](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structurify) / [MR](https://modrinth.com/mod/structurify) | GUI-based structure configuration | - |

\* - A must-have mod for nearly any modpack. Only in very rare circumstances should you not use this mod or an equivalent.

** - Prone to issues or conflicts with other mods